WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.550
Smash!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.550
Craniummon's Strongest Shield

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.140
Smash!

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.550
Craniummon's Strongest Shield!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.560
The human world is immersed in chaos.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.550
The Digimon army continued to advance as they acted upon Yggdrasil's orders to erase mankind.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.960
Yoshino, Tohma, Ikuto, and the others

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.440
decided that they should chase after Masaru, and headed to the Digital World.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.310
During that time, Masaru and Agumon were...

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:29.570
Gotsumon!

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.520
Could you...

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.010
Could you please wait a bit?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.820
Sorry, but there's no time for that!

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.170
That's right!

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.330
We have to beat Yggdrasil quickly!

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:48.400
I'm sorry, Aniki.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.410
Yggdrasil is your...

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.670
Don't worry about it, Agumon.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.260
I'll personally take Dad down!

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.430
Aniki...

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:11.540
What the hell was that?

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.230
That was a warning.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.490
The next one won't miss.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.540
You!

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.320
Cr-Craniummon!

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.390
You again.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.760
Don't get in my way, Craniummon!

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:28.580
I have to go punch out my dad!

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.080
That's impossible.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.620
What?!

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:35.110
It's impossible... because you will be eliminated here.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.640
Yggdrasil has already passed judgment.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:42.790
You humans are destined to be exterminated.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:48.900
You two Digimon over there, there is no point in throwing away your lives.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:53.840
If you renounce your support of the humans and surrender to Yggdrasil, you shall be spared.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.030
Cut the crap!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.170
Like hell I'd submit to you!

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.200
I, too...

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.490
I, too, don't believe that they are wrong!

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.310
Fools.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.660
Yggdrasil's decisions are absolute.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.570
You dare to oppose God?

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.700
Do you really think that?

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.460
Do you know what's happening on Earth right now?!

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:18.080
Loads of people are suffering!

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.460
You humans are the cause of your own torment.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.770
The egoistic behavior of millions of your species has rubbed against God's imperial wrath!

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:29.830
So just because he's a God, he can get away with anything?

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.520
I'll never accept that!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.850
This boy...

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.200
Don't you have any personal feelings about this?

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:46.940
Stop making me repeat myself.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.270
Yggdrasil's decisions are absolute.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.120
They must not be contested!

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:54.130
I guess you're just a puppet then.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:55.980
Let's go, Agumon!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.900
Okay!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:02.240
An inferior human like yourself dares to reprove a Royal Knight...

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.050
It's laughable how you don't know your place!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.720
Just so you know, you're in for a shock if you look down on humans!

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.000
Then show me...

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.650
this human potential you speak of!

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.540
Baby Flame!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:25.660
Aniki!

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:28.660
Agumon!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.930
Digisoul Charge!

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.190
Overdrive!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.750
Agumon, evolve!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.000
ShineGreymon!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.360
Emerge, my demonic shield, Avalon!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.500
What's with that shield?

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:17.790
This is the power that my God, Yggdrasil, has bestowed upon me.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:21.920
My strongest spear, Claíomh Solais, penetrates through any material,

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:26.470
and my strongest shield, Avalon, wards off every attack.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:30.620
If you humans truly do have this potential that you claim,

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.020
use it to evade my strongest spear

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:36.650
and neatly smash through my strongest shield!

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:42.110
I-I-Impossible!

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.310
That's impossible!

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.360
What made you think you could challenge a Royal Knight in battle?!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.210
I won't run away!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.030
Not until I've punched out my dad!

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:50.970
Let's go!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:51.940
Okay!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.060
Are you all right, Yoshino?

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:09.890
Yes.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:12.010
No matter how many times we come here, it's the worst.

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:17.420
Because of the air turbulence, we were swept further down from our expected landing point.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.530
Let's go to where Masaru is!

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.290
Shining Blast!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.410
Imbecile!

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:38.250
With an attack at that level...

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.430
Damn it, that hurt!!!

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.100
...just kidding!

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:54.230
Now, ShineGreymon!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.690
Glorious Burst!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:05:59.780
God Breath!

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:05.850
No way!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.860
No way, that's impossible!

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:08.040
Did you get him?

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.040
No, not yet!

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:23.540
That isn't enough to even lay a scratch on me.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.300
He's not hurt at all?!

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.070
Looks like our conquest is running smoothly.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.040
What's the matter?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:46.500
I've heard word that Craniummon is in the midst of battle in the Digital World.

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:47.870
Battle?

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:48.830
Against who?

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.420
That human we met before and ShineGreymon.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:52.320
What should we do?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.280
Not a problem.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.120
It's unthinkable that they will defeat him.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:56.970
True.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.220
He holds the strongest shield and spear.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:03.450
No one can surpass that combination.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.560
It's because their strength is assured

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:10.870
that we can accomplish our mission in the human world with confidence.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.160
Let's go.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.520
Glorious Burst!

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:44.600
He's not giving an inch.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.060
That's how solid his shield must be.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:48.750
Are you done already?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.810
In that case, I'll make my move.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.560
ShineGreymon!

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:04.730
What's the matter?

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.520
Where did all of that energy you displayed run off to?

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:09.400
It's absolutely...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.660
It's absolutely impossible!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:14.350
Fighting against a Royal Knight is suicide!

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.640
Quit yapping!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:16.970
The fight is just beginning!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:18.970
Stand up, ShineGreymon!

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.160
Stand up!

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:30.590
GeoGrey Sword!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.980
GeoGrey Sword!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.640
Interesting.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:51.210
Here I come!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.100
You...!

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:10.900
It's no use.

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:11.830
What?

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:17.610
Unfortunately, I don't even feel a smidgen of potential from you in this fight.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.320
What was that?!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.260
It's time I put an end to this.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:27.910
ShineGreymon!

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:29.760
There!

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:34.630
What?

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:36.860
We've got 'im!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.840
I'll put everything I have into this attack!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.940
The GeoGrey Sword...!

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:52.900
No way...

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.300
His sword...

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.110
It's in pieces...!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.160
See that?

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:11.620
This is Avalon's power...

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.360
and...

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.500
the true power of Claíomh Solais!

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:20.140
Hurry!

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:21.290
Fly faster!

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.490
Yes, Master.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.300
Masaru...

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.640
Please be safe!

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:26.700
It's all right.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.430
Have faith in them.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.520
Masaru. Agumon.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:55.360
Because...

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:58.140
Because I've gotten involved with these people...

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.180
What...

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:02.150
What's going to happen to me now?!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.720
Ow...

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:08.810
What should we do, Aniki?

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.990
Don't make me actually say it.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.080
I'll keep attacking!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:22.080
If 100 times don't work, then 1,000 times!

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.030
If that still doesn't work, then I'll keep going 10,000 times!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:27.730
That's just what I expected from you.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.660
They stand up again.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.030
Listen up, ShineGreymon.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:36.250
As long as our hearts don't give in, we haven't lost!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.670
That means...

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.230
we'll <i>never</i>  lose!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.630
Yeah, I know!

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:44.000
The mutual trust between them that never falters...

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:48.700
and those positive words said even in the face of this hopeless situation...

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.430
Just where is it coming from?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.430
That shield goes down first.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.520
Seems like he's pretty proud of it.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:56.900
Looks that way.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.530
Just try and think about it.

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:01.110
Think about when that shield is smashed to pieces.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.400
Yeah.

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:10.570
Charge!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:15.790
Digisoul Burst!

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.070
ShineGreymon!

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:40.390
Burst Mode!

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.990
Let's do this, you pompous bastard!

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.320
It's useless!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.620
He's too strong!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:23.490
I knew it...

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:27.400
I knew that even the idea of fighting the Royal Knights was impossible!

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:33.620
Again, you stand.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.350
Of course!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.950
I made a promise with everyone.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.720
I'm going to meet my dad...

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.830
and we're gonna talk together with our fists!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:47.400
It appears humans do love to struggle uselessly.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.300
You don't know yet if it's useless or not!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.260
As long as our hearts don't give in, we haven't lost!

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:56.560
We'll get back up on our feet as many times as we want!

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.000
In that case...

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.440
Everything will end with this next attack.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:18.790
We're finished!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.950
End Waltz!

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:24.670
Not yet!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:27.040
Like hell I'm gonna let that finish me off!!

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:31.030
Full Moon Blaster!

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:41.480
That's enough!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:44.980
We won't let you lay another finger on them!

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:47.160
We won't forgive you!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.670
You guys...

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.440
Why...?

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.000
A miracle...

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.750
A miracle has occurred!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.650
What are you doing?

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:00.920
Why did you come here?

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:04.200
Don't say that, we came because we were worried about you.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.830
I never asked you to.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.300
Consider this a loan.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.900
You can pay me back later.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.050
All of us will fight together!

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.150
There are more of you.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:17.990
How can you readily leap into this battle when you have no possibility of winning?

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:20.470
Possibility, huh?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.430
Let me tell you something nice.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.920
There are things in this world that won't simply go according to calculation.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:30.870
That goes especially for Masaru.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.080
Calculations and common sense never work on him.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:39.580
No matter how hopeless the situation was, all of us broke through it together.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.820
I'll tell you this, Craniummon.

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:45.910
Potential is something that'll come surging out from anywhere

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:48.290
just as long as you don't give up!

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.290
What nonsense.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.240
Charge!

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.240
Charge!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.270
Digisoul Burst!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.270
Digisoul Burst!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.550
MirageGaogamon!

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.890
Burst Mode!

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:26.710
Rosemon!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:27.980
Burst Mode!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:34.600
Ravemon!

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:35.930
Burst Mode!

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.420
Burst Modes?

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:39.260
When did that happen?

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.370
Let's go, everyone!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.260
Yes!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.260
Yes!

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:43.900
His shield!

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:44.720
Aim for his shield!

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.150
I see...

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:48.980
You've done some thinking, Masaru.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.200
I get it.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:54.310
If we destroy his shield first, we'll lower Craniummon's defense,

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:56.610
then we can attack through his breaches, am I right?

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.450
That's not it!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:02.830
I just want to push him off his high horse!

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:05.850
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:05.850
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.470
Go, ShineGreymon!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:10.810
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:10.810
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.040
It's pointless!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:12.340
Final Mirage Burst!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.920
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.920
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.540
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.540
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.840
Aguichant Lèvres!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:21.350
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:21.350
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:22.010
Musou-tenshou-yoku-no-jin!

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:22.010
Unmatched Soaring Wing Formation

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.310
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.310
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.600
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.600
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.450
I'm telling you it's useless!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:31.770
No matter how many times you try, my strongest shield, Avalon, will never fracture!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:33.870
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:33.870
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:33.100
What?!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:39.670
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:39.670
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.620
A-A crack...

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:36.690
There's a crack!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.350
By never giving up and attacking...

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:45.840
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:45.840
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.140
attacking so many times,

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.700
they've made the impossible possible!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:44.920
Now's our chance!

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.450
All of you bear down on him!

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:47.530
Yes, Master!

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.300
Tiferet!

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:59.830
<b>tada hitotsu no yakusoku ga sekai wo kaeru</b>

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:59.830
<b>Just one promise will change the world</b>

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:55.920
Got you!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.460
Musou-tenshou-yoku-no-jin!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:04.790
<b>chiisana koro miageteta hoshi no you ni</b>

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:04.790
<b>Like the stars you gazed up at when you were little</b>

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:10.520
<b>kokoro no oku de matataku hikari</b>

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:10.520
<b>The light that twinkles inside your heart</b>

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.640
This is it!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:12.170
Final Shining Burst!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:15.330
<b>yume to iu na no kagayaki e</b>

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:15.330
<b>Shapes into a radiance known as "dreams"</b>

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.400
<b>You can be a shootin' star!</b>

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.400
<b>You can be a shootin' star!</b>

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:22.690
<b>sore ga kimi no yakusoku</b>

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:22.690
<b>That is your promise</b>

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:27.960
<b>kurayami wo kirisakeru sono chikara</b>

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:27.960
<b>The power to tear the darkness to pieces</b>

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:23.800
What?

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.430
Time to show you, Craniummon!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.740
This is...

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:33.760
<b>omoi no tsuyosa ga supiido ageru kara</b>

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:33.760
<b>The strength of your feelings will raise your speed</b>

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:31.790
a human's potential!!

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:39.930
<b>sono mama tobunda Believer!</b>

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:39.930
<b>So fly on as you are, Believer!</b>

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.350
Craniummon's...

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.530
Craniummon's shield...

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:48.220
My shield...

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.680
This human...

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.550
Well now,

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.280
that shield you're so proud of is gone.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.720
Now we can...

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:03.860
What?

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:06.570
The fight ends here.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.750
What do you mean?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.530
I've told you earlier

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:18.580
to evade my strongest spear and smash through my strongest shield.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.050
You've done just that.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.280
In other words, I have lost.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.510
You may go.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.640
Are you serious?

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.160
Of course.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.960
You have revealed your potential to me.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.480
Craniummon.

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:35.210
Hurry and go.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.190
Before I change my mind.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.650
Yeah, we'll do that.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.360
Masaru, don't let your guard down. It could be a trap.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.950
Don't worry.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.320
He won't do something petty like that.

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.120
Masaru.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.280
How can you tell?

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:50.990
It's obvious!

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.790
We've talked with these!

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:05.800
Daimon Masaru.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:10.230
I shall stake the two worlds on that infinite potential of yours.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.680
God is not absolute.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.650
BanchouLeomon,

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:16.970
were you aware of that?

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:31.260
Wait for me, Dad!

